5. Judge duplicate_status from the provided deterministic candidates: unique | near_duplicate | duplicate. Include duplicate_score (0.0–1.0) and duplicate_candidate_ids[].
6. Assign final validation_status (good | upgrade | bad) per the TAGGING RULES.

